opens100 provides CMake targets:

    find_package(opens100 CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE opens100::featurecatalog opens100::geometry)

Headers keep the module directory names:

    #include <FeatureCatalog/FeatureCatalogue.h>
    #include <GeoMetryLibrary/MBR.h>

The System Database (feature "system-database") is opens100::sdb:

    #include <SystemDatabase/SystemDatabase.h>
